            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>Restored the current Settings screen and the option to fill in a debrief yourself. Reworked carousel Border and Shadow controls with a live thickness slider, brand-color and custom swatches, and simple shadow presets. Borders now render on every edge. Fixed the EXPORT button so it shows its yellow again.</p>
